<title>JAPAN: Daiwa Sec to unveil Oct-Dec results on Monday.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Sec to unveil Oct-Dec results on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Securities Co Ltd said it would unveil its parent business results for the October-December quarter at 3.30 p.m. (0630 GMT) on Monday.</p>
<p>The announcement will be made at the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
